Add landmarks inside kalloc_init()

kmem_range_init() now prints all 17 kmem claims and the range table, so
it completes.  Of the two STARTUP_RANK_THIRD functions only
kalloc_init() is left before the console goes quiet, and it is the first
code that allocates real memory through the 4K pmap, so a landmark per
step names the failing call instead of the function.

